{"product_id":"teen-eli-readers-english-david-copperfield-cd","title":"Teen ELI Readers - English: David Copperfield + CD","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe story traces the life of David Copperfield from childhood to maturity. In this Reader you will find: information about Charles Dickens Tags Family Friendship Love Adventure David Copperfield looks back on the first twenty-five years of his life. He is only eight years old when his mother, a young pretty widow, remarries. Unfortunately Mr Murdstone is not a good husband or father. David is sent away to school and only returns home when tragedy strikes. Unloved and unwanted, he is sent to work in a factory. But David is a resourceful boy and determines to find a better life for himself.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 150 x 210\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Charles Dickens\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9788853607836\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 79\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45472788807833,"sku":"7RC9788853607836","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/684ff95ab8063_Teen_ELI_Readers_-_English-_David_Copperfield___CD_Charles_Dickens__1.jpg?v=1752084374","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/teen-eli-readers-english-david-copperfield-cd","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}